  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 4.14,
      "text": "One day, they make you feel like the most interesting person in the room."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 4.14,
      "end": 6.64,
      "text": "The next, they barely reply."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 6.64,
      "end": 11.64,
      "text": "And somehow, the less certain you feel, the more you think about them. Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 11.64,
      "end": 18.06,
      "text": "Have you ever noticed how an unanswered message can occupy your mind longer than a great conversation?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 18.06,
      "end": 23.56,
      "text": "It's tempting to call that chemistry, but sometimes what feels like intense attraction"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 23.56,
      "end": 26.26,
      "text": "may be partly fueled by uncertainty."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 26.26,
      "end": 31.3,
      "text": "When you don't know where you stand, your mind starts searching for clues."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 31.3,
      "end": 37.9,
      "text": "You replay the compliment. You analyze the delay. You wonder what that one emoji really meant."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 37.9,
      "end": 42.5,
      "text": "Every detail feels important because you're trying to answer one question."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 42.5,
      "end": 48.06,
      "text": "Do they like me? And when you can't find an answer, it's easy to keep thinking about it."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 48.06,
      "end": 53.48,
      "text": "Then, there are the moments when they do give you attention. A kind message arrives after days of silence,"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 53.48,
      "end": 56.9,
      "text": "and suddenly you feel relieved."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 56.9,
      "end": 59.48,
      "text": "The connection seems exciting again."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 59.48,
      "end": 65.12,
      "text": "That swing between uncertainty and relief can make it harder to step back and see the whole pattern,"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 65.12,
      "end": 69.98,
      "text": "but it doesn't automatically mean the other person is manipulating you."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 69.98,
      "end": 75.48,
      "text": "Sometimes, people are simply busy, unsure, or looking for something different."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 75.48,
      "end": 80.14,
      "text": "The problem is that uncertainty also leaves room for imagination."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 80.14,
      "end": 83.78,
      "text": "Maybe you focus on who they could become"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 83.78,
      "end": 86.22,
      "text": "instead of how they treat you right now."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 86.22,
      "end": 90.74,
      "text": "So ask yourself, do their actions generally match their words?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 90.74,
      "end": 95.36,
      "text": "Can you talk honestly about what you want? Do you feel respected?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 95.36,
      "end": 99.52,
      "text": "Thinking about someone constantly isn't proof that they're right for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 99.52,
      "end": 104.94,
      "text": "Sometimes, your mind is working overtime because it needs clarity,"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 104.94,
      "end": 107.14,
      "text": "and you don't have to decode every signal alone."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 107.14,
      "end": 113.3,
      "text": "When it feels right, ask a clear question, listen to the answer, and notice what happens next."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 113.3,
      "end": 115.68,
      "text": "Because attraction can feel exciting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 115.68,
      "end": 119.68,
      "text": "but clarity helps you decide what's actually good for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 119.68,
      "end": 124.41,
      "text": "What's one sign of a healthy connection you value? Share it in the comments."
    }
  ],
